      "writtenOn": "2022-08-03T02:19:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just tested it out, this change + ARC-specific change helps the test pass and leave the test device in a usable state. Without this change, my device ends up in a wifi-disabled state. I think with both pieces, we can pass the CTS now, thank you!",
